  "build_depends": ["qt6-virtualkeyboard-dev", "librime-dev", "cmake", "ninja-build", "plasma-keyboard"],
  "description": "Plasma Mobile on Android: Rime Chinese input\nThe Rime (luna pinyin) input method for Plasma Keyboard: a Qt Virtual Keyboard\nplugin, the Chinese layout using it, and the keyboard launcher KWin starts.",
